# Drizzle & Postgres

- Schema per module: `modules/<m>/infrastructure/**/drizzle/schema.ts`.
- Aggregated client: `src/common/adapters/db/drizzle/client.ts` (lazy singleton).
- Repositories: implement domain port; map rows with `toDomain`; never leak `UserRow` to application.
- Factory is the seam — `getUserRepository()` etc.
- Cross-module schema imports: use relative paths in schema files (drizzle-kit alias limits).
- After schema change: `make db-generate` then commit SQL under `drizzle/`.
- Repositories accept optional `db` param for integration tests (default `getDb()`).

Commands: `db:generate`, `db:migrate`, `db:seed`, `db:studio`.
